v class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"82378177\"/></p><p><strong>3 Inch Brass Impeller Submersible Pumps</strong><br/></p><p><img alt=\"image007(001).jpg\" height=\"703\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231142243479128.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 703px;\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p><p>3 Inch Brass Impeller Submersible Pumps are equipped with permanent magnet motors, these flexible and compact pumps offer excellent efficiency levels and will supply pump heads up to 73m.If the vortex impeller submersible pump is connected to the JIADI control box, it enables a constant pressure water supply.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3SKm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power Type</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Body Material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless Steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand Name</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">For use with what product?</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Water Well</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">73m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q Max.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2.5 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.55-1.1kW/ 0.75-1.5HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor:</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">oil filled, 100% Copper Wire</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">75 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">478mm-602mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1 inch</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220-240/380-415 volts, 50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">One year manufacturer's warranty from the purchase date for parts and labor.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2.Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" height=\"841\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231144175192027.jpg\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 841px;\" title=\"image009(001).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image006(001).jpg\" height=\"739\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231142203675464.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: 600px; height: 739px;\" title=\"image006(001).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3.Spare parts benefits</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><p>Copper Motor </p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231145085715385.jpg\"/></p><p>·Pure copper</p><p>·50Hz or 60Hz can be designed</p><p>·High speed and efficiency</p><p>·With food grade oil never pollute the water</p><p>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor</p><p><br/></p></td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><p>Cable </p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231145167078671.jpg\"/></p><p>·Four cores cable</p><p>·Rubber protecting the wire</p><p>·Durable material last longer</p><p>·Various colors available</p><p>·Cable produced by JIADI</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><p>Rotor Shaft </p><p><img alt=\"image014(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231145278372450.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision machine process</p><p>·Super smooth shaft surface(mirror finish), reduce energy loss and mechanical seal abrasion</p><p><br/></p></td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal </p><p><img alt=\"image016(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231145372864928.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision Carborundum Graphite mechanical seal</p><p>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe</p><p>·Water and sand proof keep the motor safe</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4.Application</strong></p><p>For water supply from wells or reservoirs.</p><p>For domestic use,for civil and industrial applications.</p><p>For sprinkling and flow irrigation plants.</p><p>These pumps are designed to lift water form wells of size 3'',3.5'',4'',5'',6'' up to maximum.</p><p><strong>5.Operating conditions:</strong></p><p>Water temperature up to 35 Cent.Degree.</p><p>Maximum sand content: 0.25%</p><p>Minimum international diameter of well: 3''.</p><p>Maximum immersion depth: 100m</p><p><strong>6.Materials</strong><